            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A wireless communication system has a wireless communication device (1) and a wireless communication device (2). The wireless communication device (2) transmits, to a wireless communication device (3), data transmitted from the wireless communication device (1). The wireless communication device (1) has a communicator (11) and a controller (14). The communicator (11) transmits data addressed to the wireless communication device (3), to the wireless communication device (2) and receives, from the wireless communication device (2), information on communication quality of the data. The controller (14) controls delivery of the data in accordance with the information on the communication quality.</p>
